timeline.body:
@mhugo There was a lucene 8.11 release a few weeks back which unfortunately did not contain the fix. I don't think these bugs justify the effort to make another release just after that one so it is going to take a while until there is an official release that contains the fix.

We understand that this is a regression so in order to provide the fix as quickly as we can, we are going to use our own tessellator until the official release is done. At that point we will remove the copy added here.

hope it makes sense.

